SUMMARY:LeapDive with the Fairies: Manifestation Workshop + Blue Ghost Fir
 efly Tour ✨
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**LeapDive with the Fairies: Manifestatio
 n Workshop + Blue Ghost Firefly Tour**\n\nJoin us for a unique one-day exp
 erience at Terra Nova Center combining guided manifestation work\, nature 
 immersion\, and a rare nighttime tour to see the Blue Ghost Fireflies.\n\n
 ✨ Includes:\n\n* Manifestation + release practices\n* Labyrinth walk\n* 
 Partner exercises + optional breathwork\n* Community potluck\n* Private fi
 refly tour (seasonal + limited)\n\n🌿 Optional overnight stay (camping o
 r lodging available)\nThis event is perfect for those looking to reconnect
  with nature\, gain clarity\, and experience something truly unique.\n\n
 📍 Near Asheville\, NC\n🎟️ Limited spots available. Reserve your ti
 ckets here: https://leapdivewithfairies.eventbrite.com
